# Observability

- Every request/event handler logs a correlation id (or disruption id) already present in context; never invent a disconnected id.
- New error paths must be explicit: log + metric + non-success signal to the caller when appropriate.
- Do not log payloads that may contain PII; log identifiers and reason codes instead.
- If you change behavior on the Zero Touch path, update or add a metric the on-call can chart.
